  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Athletic Fit Freedom T-Shirt combines comfort, style, and a patriotic design for those who want a versatile shirt with an athletic fit. Made from a soft cotton / polyester ring-spun blend, this t-shirt feels great against the skin and is durable enough for everyday wear. The \"Freedom\" graphic is proudly printed on the center chest, serving as a bold statement. Its updated fit includes an insert collar, wider chest, and smaller sleeves, creating a more streamlined and athletic appearance. The tag-less label ensures that you stay comfortable all day long without the irritation of a traditional tag. Whether you&rsquo;re heading to the gym, out for a casual day, or just relaxing, Rothco&rsquo;s Athletic Fit Freedom T-Shirt is designed for maximum comfort and mobility.</p>",
